<ul class="reason-list">
<li><strong>No Google account needed</strong><span>You don't need to sign in to anything to get it.</span></li>
<li><strong>Phones without Google</strong><span>It works on privacy-focused versions of Android and on phones sold without the Play Store.</span></li>
