<div class="panel" id="expect">
<h2>What to expect</h2>
<dl class="expect-list">
<div><dt>Updates aren't automatic</dt><dd>When there's a new version, download it from this page and install it over the top. <a href="/whats-new/">What's new</a> lists every release.</dd></div>
<div><dt>Your phone will warn you</dt><dd>Android shows a warning for every app installed this way. That's normal.</dd></div>
